abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code and processed resources supporting the study
  "Integrative single-nucleus multi-omics and Mendelian randomization
  analyses prioritize SMAD3 as a candidate susceptibility gene linking
  aging-associated fibro-adipogenic progenitor dysregulation to inguinal
  hernia."

repository-code: "https://github.com/hani-sabaie/IH-Aging-Multiomics"

license: MIT

